    529  f920							; MIRROR space (display col 39-c) — but the strip is an OBJECT drawn on ONE
    530  f920							; side only. A player at the MIRRORED column (display 37-38) therefore
    531  f920							; compared equal to a strip drawn at display 2-3, ~80 px away, and died on
